; Regression test for #3240: expected output that depended on the day the
; suite ran -- a budget accruing up to today, a date written without a
; year -- stopped matching as the calendar moved on.  Unless a test passes
; its own --now, test/RegressTests.py runs ledger as of 2030/06/15, so each
; of these reports is the same on every run.

~ monthly
    Expenses:Rent    $500.00
    Assets:Cash

2026/01/01 Landlord
    Expenses:Rent    $500.00
    Assets:Cash

1/15 Grocer
    Expenses:Food    $20.00
    Assets:Cash

test eval today
2030/06/15
end test

; The budget accrues every month up to the current one.
test budget Rent
     $500.00    $27000.00   $-26500.00    2%  Expenses:Rent
end test

; A date written without a year falls in the current year.
test reg Food
30-Jan-15 Grocer                Expenses:Food                $20.00       $20.00
end test
